WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
May I please request you to stay
on stage and present the award.

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:06.110
Now, we would like to call
up on stage the winner

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.230
of the Global Women
of Influence Awards 2026.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:14.970
First up, we have Dr.
SHEKINAIH SIEW SIN YAP from Singapore.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.840
She is a Singapore-based entrepreneur,

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.460
international business leader, author,

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.420
humanitarian advocate,
and peace ambassador,

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:28.520
more than three decades spent
auditing at Deloitte Corporate Banking

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:32.420
and an international hydroelectric
joint venture in Fujian, China.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.460
She is now founder
of Crowned Eagles Global

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.220
and managing partner of CE Global Network.
